BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
SUMMARY:🏋️ Push
DESCRIPTION:About 45–55 min.\n\nSquat 3 x 5–8\nIncline dumbbell press 3
 –4 x 8–10\nSuperset: chest-supported row 3 x 8–10 + lateral raise 3 
 x 10–15\nTriceps pushdown 2 x 10–12\n\nJumps: 2 x 10 countermovement j
 umps (weekly target 60). Land softly\, rest 30-60 s.
UID:rc-strength-2026-10-26-mon@runcoach
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261028
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261029
SUMMARY:🏋️ Pull
DESCRIPTION:About 45–55 min.\n\nTrap-bar deadlift 3 x 5\nPulldown or pull
 -up 3 x 8–10\nSuperset: overhead press 3 x 8–10 + face pull 3 x 12–1
 5\nIncline dumbbell curl 2–3 x 10–12\n\nJumps: 2 x 10 countermovement 
 jumps (weekly target 60). Land softly\, rest 30-60 s.
UID:rc-strength-2026-10-28-wed@runcoach
END:VEVENT
