DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
SUMMARY:🏋️ Full
DESCRIPTION:About 45–55 min.\n\nLeg press or split squat 3 x 8\nBench 3 x
  8–10\nSuperset: single-arm row 3 x 8–10 + lateral raise 3 x 10–15\n
 Superset: hammer curl + overhead triceps extension 2 x 10–12\nFarmer car
 ries 2 x 30–40 m if time allows\n\nJumps: 2 x 10 countermovement jumps (
 weekly target 60). Land softly\, rest 30-60 s.
UID:rc-strength-2026-10-30-fri@runcoach
